Scope of this license

The MIT terms above cover the code and documentation in this repository:
index.html, tools/solve.py, the ISA and README, and the
example loadout.

They do not cover the pet Advance cost tables in
data/pet-advance-costs.json. Those figures are derived from the Kingshot
Optimizer pets database (https://kingshotoptimizer.com/database/pets/) and
are reproduced here for interoperability; they are not the copyright holder's
to relicense. Anyone redistributing that data should refer to the source.

Kingshot is a product of Century Games. This project is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by either.
